schema_example:
Return a JSON object with an "annotations" key containing an array of annotation objects. Each object must follow this schema exactly:

{"id": "ann_1", "type": "<type>", "anchor": {"type": "TextQuoteSelector", "exact": "<text copied verbatim from the input>", "prefix": "<~15 chars before>", "suffix": "<~15 chars after>"}, "content": {"note": "<annotation text>", "why_it_matters": "<optional: one sentence on significance>", "question": "<optional: follow-up question>", "suggestions": ["<optional>"]}}

Every annotation must provide distinct value.

